<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>คำสั่งซื้อของฉัน - NEXTREAD</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #f8fafc;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text-color: #0f172a;
            --text-sub: #64748b;
            --accent-color: #2563eb;
            --border-color: #e2e8f0;
        }

        body.dark-mode {
            --bg-color: #0b1120;
            --card-bg: #1e293b;
            --text-color: #f8fafc;
            --text-sub: #94a3b8;
            --accent-color: #3b82f6;
            --border-color: #334155;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            padding-bottom: 15px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        a.btn-back {
            color: var(--accent-color);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .order-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .order-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-bottom: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .status-pending {
            background: #fef08a;
            color: #854d0e;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .status-approved {
            background: #bbf7d0;
            color: #166534;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .item-list {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .item {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 10px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--border-color);
        }

        .item:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .download-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 6px;
            color: var(--accent-color);
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .download-btn:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .order-total {
            text-align: right;
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-top: 12px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <h1>📦 คำสั่งซื้อของฉัน</h1>
            <a href="/" class="btn-back">← กลับหน้าหลัก</a>
        </header>

        <% if (orders && orders.length > 0) { %>
            <% orders.forEach(order => { %>
                <div class="order-card">
                    <div class="order-header">
                        <div>
                            <strong>คำสั่งซื้อ #<%= order.id %></strong>
                            <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-sub); margin-top: 2px;">
                                <%= new Date(order.created_at).toLocaleString('th-TH') %>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <% if (order.status === 'approved') { %>
                                <span class="status-approved">✅ ชำระเงินแล้ว (อนุมัติแล้ว)</span>
                            <% } else if (order.status === 'pending') { %>
                                <span class="status-pending">⏳ รอผู้ดูแลระบบตรวจสอบ</span>
                            <% } else { %>
                                <span>ยกเลิกคำสั่งซื้อ</span>
                            <% } %>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <ul class="item-list">
                        <% order.items.forEach(item => { %>
                            <li class="item">
                                <div>
                                    <strong><%= item.book_title %></strong>
                                    <% if (order.status === 'approved') { %>
                                        <br>
                                        <% if (item.download_token) { %>
                                            <a href="/download/<%= item.download_token %>" class="download-btn">คลิกอ่าน / ดาวน์โหลด E-Book</a>
                                        <% } %>
                                    <% } %>
                                </div>
                                <div>฿<%= item.price %></div>
                            </li>
                        <% }) %>
                    </ul>

                    <div class="order-total">
                        ราคารวมสุทธิ: <span style="color: var(--accent-color);">฿<%= order.total_price %></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            <% }) %>
        <% } else { %>
            <p style="text-align: center; color: var(--text-sub); margin-top: 50px;">ยังไม่มีรายการคำสั่งซื้อ</p>
        <% } %>
    </div>

    <script>
        if (localStorage.getItem('theme') === 'dark') {
            document.body.classList.add('dark-mode');
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>